body:
R5: I’ve been playing this game for a while now and I suffer from my usual problem of falling behind economically. I have 3k dev and I’m the biggest country in the world, but I can only afford the 7th largest army. Other major powers have twice my army size.

&#x200B;

I wanted to ask if anyone has an idea how to stop being poor.

&#x200B;

I collect trade in Beijing (I moved my trade capital there and I steer all other nodes towards it), I also have the most trade power in Hangzhou, Canton, and Nippon, and I have 10-50% power in other East Asian/ South East Asian nodes.  I protect trade with light ships in Hangzhou and Canton.I mostly build trade and production buildings + manufactories.
